# Earflow Platform

Микросервисная музыкальная платформа. Документация: `AGENTS.md`, `docs/earflow-architecture-map.md`, `reports/SERVICE_MAP.md`.

## Domains

`earflow.ru` (listener), `auth.earflow.ru`, `api.earflow.ru`, `artists.earflow.ru`, `strmhaha.earflow.ru`

## Layers

Nginx edge → Go gateway (`backend/go-api-gateway`) → Node services → Postgres/Redis/MinIO/Meilisearch/NATS

## Code principles

- Client UI prefs (mini bar, play style): `.cursor/rules/earflow-ui-client-prefs.mdc`, `INV-FE-006..008`
- Mobile player sheet / dismiss: `.cursor/rules/earflow-player-sheet.mdc`, `INV-SHEET-001..006`, `npm run verify:player-mobile`
- Minimal diff; match existing patterns in the touched service
- No secrets in source; use `.env` / env vars
- Parameterized SQL; server-side auth on every protected endpoint
- JWT/sessions via httpOnly cookies (`mp_auth`, `mp_sid`, `mp_csrf`) — never localStorage
- Do not weaken CSRF, rate limits, or header stripping in gateway without security review

## Key paths

- Listener UI: `frontend/src/`
- Artist UI: `artist-frontend/src/`
- Gateway routes: `backend/go-api-gateway/gateway.yaml`
- Ops scripts: `scripts/platform-control.sh`
